    "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Restore durable context before accepting this update**\n\nThe repository has no configured remote, and fresh GitHub reads for current `main`, issue #106, PR #110, the candidate commit's PR, and workflow evidence were unavailable due missing authentication/HTTP 403. Therefore the required base/HEAD and CI bindings for this compiler upgrade cannot be established; local tests passing is insufficient, so this review must remain `DURABLE_CONTEXT_NOT_PROVEN` rather than being treated as PASS.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L13-L19](https://github.com/Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-shared-hq/blob/7b08468acb0b741317ecfbc9a5a230a9fee6b14f/AGENTS.md#L13-L19)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
