    "body": "Upstream-backed repair for the current R03 live blocker.\n\nExact head: `7b08468acb0b741317ecfbc9a5a230a9fee6b14f`.\n\nEvidence already established on this head:\n- upstream github/gh-aw PR #54305 removes the generated Copilot ripgrep bootstrap dependency;\n- official gh-aw v0.87.2 compiler asset pinned by SHA-256;\n- exact compiler-generated lock installed without hand editing;\n- compiler read-only gate GREEN;\n- hq-validate full 248-test suite, scope guard, and Control Tower integrity GREEN;\n- changed files exactly compiler workflow, generated lock, and regression test.\n\nThis PR replaces closed draft #174 because the connected GitHub GraphQL `mark ready` operation is currently broken; code/head are unchanged.\n\nNo production event mutation, no PR #111/#103 or issue #102 mutation.",
